B.a0a=new A.a6("How do I delete data?","Settings \u2192 delete data on this device, or uninstall. Telemetry: suporte@perfectgestdev.com.")
B.a0m=new A.a6("Suggestions?","Company tab or suporte@perfectgestdev.com.")
